---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import ResponsiveContainer from "../components/ResponsiveContainer.astro";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import professionalHeadshot from "../assets/ProfessionalHeadshot.png";
---

<Layout>
	<h2>About Me</h2>
	<ResponsiveContainer widths={[2, 10]} columnGap="1em" rowGap="1em">
		<Image
			src={professionalHeadshot}
			alt="Saurabh Totey"
			style="width: 100%; height: auto; background-color: #454545;"
		/>
		<div>
			<p style={{ marginTop: "0" }}>
				Hello! I am a homo sapien named &ldquo;Saurabh Totey&rdquo; (or &ldquo;सौरभ तोटे&rdquo; or
				&ldquo;トテ・ソウラブ&rdquo;) that uses he/him pronouns. It is often simpler to refer to me as
				&ldquo;S.T.&rdquo;, but for those determined to learn how to pronounce my name, my instructions are to
				concatenate the words &ldquo;dinosaur&rdquo; and &ldquo;rub&rdquo; and then remove the &ldquo;dino&rdquo;
				prefix!
			</p>
			<p>
				My principal interests are in theoretical quantum computing (algorithms/complexity) and in building software!
			</p>
			<p>
				My fascination in quantum computing stems mainly from the desire to re-interpret natural processes as
				&ldquo;computations&rdquo; and then see what the various bounds and limits we can apply or impose based off of
				quantum complexity results. My background particularly is in open and many body systems, partition function
				estimation, thermal states, and bosonic systems.
			</p>
			<p>
				As for software, I love thinking about how systems work, and software systems run the world! Reasoning logically
				about how to piece things together to create something great is always a fun challenge! I especially care about
				correctness, performance, and reliability, which are necessary for so-called &ldquo;good&rdquo; software!
			</p>
		</div>
	</ResponsiveContainer>
</Layout>
